{"id":268681429640177,"type":"artist","name":"Eat Static","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":17,"info":{"bio":"Eat Static is Merv Pepler, an electronic music project from England, UK formed in 1990. Joie Hinton left the group in February 2008 after 18 years to spend more time with his family.\n\nMerv Pepler and Joie Hinton met as drummer and keyboard player (respectively) for the Ozric Tentacles, a long-standing psychedelic \"space-rock\" band from Somerset. Although the Ozrics incorporated elements of electronic music, Pepler and Hinton were drawn towards the rave-oriented dance music. <a href=\"https://www.last.fm/music/Eat+Static\">Read more on Last.fm</a>","tags":["psytrance","electronic","goa","psychedelic","trance"],"img":"https://lastfm.freetls.fastly.net/i/u/300x300/2a96cbd8b46e442fc41c2b86b821562f.png","similar":["Hallucinogen","The Infinity Project","Astralasia","Cosmosis","Banco De Gaia"],"listeners":"101741","links":{"lastfm":"https://www.last.fm/music/Eat+Static"}},"works":[{"id":49880883417641,"type":"album","name":"Prepare Your Spirit","artist":"Eat Static","year":1992,"weight":5,"yt":"2YPZXntQA08","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":246383095919220,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Belgian Techno","rank":13,"scaruffi":null},{"id":128299104800616,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Breakbeat Hardcore","rank":91,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":87728267716271,"type":"album","name":"Abduction","artist":"Eat Static","year":1993,"weight":5,"yt":"Ck3SORdALcA","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":226746074393320,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Psytrance","rank":44,"scaruffi":null},{"id":263737305677328,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Trance","rank":118,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":85823038676281,"type":"album","name":"Epsylon","artist":"Eat Static","year":1995,"weight":6,"yt":"yfbc1CSa7Cg","src":"books","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":